<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-076" chapter-id="c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun" source-id="s-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun-ws1997726">
  <p id="c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：<persName id="c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0004" ref="j6y_10h_eso">脩之</persName>、<persName id="c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0007" ref="af1_11d_057">宗慤</persName>，皆以將帥之材，懷廉潔之操，有足稱焉。<persName id="c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0028" ref="31b_fd1_f77">玄謨</persName>雖苛剋少恩，然觀其大節，亦足為美。當少帝失道，多所殺戮，而能冒履不測，傾心輔弼，斯可謂忘身徇國者歟。</p>
</text>
